<title>USA: Pentair buys Transrack of France.</title>
<headline>Pentair buys Transrack of France.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pentair Inc said Monday it acquired Transrack S.A. from Groupe Schneider of France. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The purchase of Transrack, a manufacturer of cabinets, work stations and electronics enclosures based in Bonneuil sur Marne, is expected to close on January 28.</p>
<p>Pentair said the acquisition is part of its expansion in the world wide enclosure market.</p>
<p>Transrack will continue to operate and market products under its own name, the company said.</p>
<p>Pentair is a diversified manufacturer.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
